is a string (or None for deserialization), violating type safety. The type hint 
is `lines_read: str` but the constructor accepts any type, including `int`, 
`list`, etc.\n\n## Lens\n**Phase 1: The Intent vs. Reality Check - Type 
Safety**\n\n## Expected vs. Observed\n| Expected Behavior | Observed Risk 
